> I competed in my first ever triathlon yesterday, which also marked the first time wearing spandex outside the house (photo intentionally deleted). I had a fabulous time competing, but[ Olymp]ian[ Simon] Whitfield can sleep peacefully knowing that I will not be challenging any of his records any time soon.
